    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d208">

                <pb facs="0471" n="443" sameAs="frus:frus1955-57v23p1/pg443"/>

                <head>208. Memorandum From the Assistant Secretary of State for Far Eastern Affairs
                    (Robertson) to the Secretary of State<anchor n="1" xml:id="d208-f1"/></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                ><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                                when="1957-08-16">August 16, 1957</date>.</hi></dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Follow-up Actions on Kishi Visit</item>
                </list>
                <p>Attached for your information is a report on the actions taken and present status
                    of the various matters raised during the course of Prime Minister Kishi’s
                    visit.</p>



                <xi:include href="d208-a1.xml" xpointer="d208-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
